Here's a clear overview of the AyaTech Site project structure:

📁 Project Structure
The repo has 3 main sub-projects inside ayatech-site-main/:

Folder	Purpose	Status
web/	Main public website (Next.js)	✅ Active — has Razorpay, Supabase, courses, apply, dashboard
ayatech-erp/	ERP/Admin portal (Next.js)	✅ Active — auth, admin, apply, dashboard
ayatech-site/	Old site	⚠️ Empty
admission-ai/	AI admission helper	🔬 Experimental
web/ App Routes
/ — Home page
/apply — Application form
/courses — Courses listing
/store — Store
/dashboard — User dashboard
/payment-success — Post-payment page
/test-one-rupee — Live payment test page
/gvedc, /igcse-school, /hackathons, /tinkering — Special pages
ayatech-erp/ App Routes
/login, /register, /forgot-password — Auth
/dashboard — ERP Dashboard
/admin — Admin panel
/apply — ERP application form
